        "short_description": {
            "database_value": "France FinTech is a nonprofit professional association established in 2015, dedicated to uniting and representing French fintech, insurtech, and regtech entrepreneurs. Based in Paris, it aims to promote excellence in the financial services sector both in France and internationally. The association serves as a voice for financial innovation, advocating for its members with public authorities and regulators.\n\nFrance FinTech fosters connections among startups, technological companies, venture capitalists, law and consulting firms, banks, and insurers. It organizes significant industry events, such as the French FinTech Week, and manages initiatives like FinTech R:Evolution. The association categorizes its members into eight specific fintech families based on their operational and technological models and publishes annual reports analyzing sector trends. Through these efforts, France FinTech supports its members in developing innovative solutions that leverage advanced technologies like AI, blockchain, and data science.",
            "ai_value": "France FinTech est l'association qui rassemble et accompagne la croissance de tous les acteurs du secteur de la fintech française à travers des rendez-vous, publications et initiatives stratégiques."
        },
